	(text "RDEL 4.53k = 50 ns. RON 31.6k / ROFF 14.3k:\nfree-run 656 kHz (590-708), synced to\n737.28 kHz, DMAX 0.68-0.715. RSLOPE 316k.\nCSS 1u: 60 ms soft start. PD_PG holds SS\nlow during PD inrush; UCC_SS -> block A.\nGND (8) and PGND (13) meet only at the IC\n(datasheet 11.1). B-controller.md"
